  unitName: Noble Links Johan
  unitId: 61046
  unitNumber: 1497
  description: The most trusted staff officer of the Randall Empire's first emperor.
    Identifying the emperor's talents before his rise, Johan spread word that he
    was the descendant of a hero who had led the people of Elgaia, which helped win
    unprecedented support. After the empire's founding, Johan laid the foundations
    for its government and the current system of aristocracy. However, he also set
    about permanently eliminating all obstacles to his own personal ideals, and even
    attempted to execute the decorated leader of the volunteer army. This earned
    him widespread animosity, and he was assassinated by an unknown individual with
    his ambitions still unfulfilled.
  summonDesc: It seems our interests are aligned. I will keep getting my hands dirty
    in order to form a perfect nation!
  fusionDesc: This technique for using talented people... It's so logical, so breathtaking!
    There's a lesson in government to be learned from this.
